The world's photo textures, scanned props and skies.

Every file in this folder is from Poly Haven (polyhaven.com), released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): dedicated to the public domain, free to use, change
and redistribute for any purpose, with no attribution required. They are credited here anyway.

They are not the files as downloaded. Each was fetched from Poly Haven's own API at its 1k
resolution, its checksum matched against the one the API published, and then made smaller for a
browser: textures re-encoded as WebP (colour and normal maps at 1024 px, the ambient
occlusion/roughness/metalness map at 512 px); skies averaged down to 512 x 256 and written as
uncompressed Radiance RGBE; models cut to one variant, their transforms baked, decimated with
meshoptimizer to a few thousand triangles at most, and their textures packed into the .glb as
512 px WebP.

